				A strange change from GB is the frequency of the AI wingman's callouts to you in mission. Sure, 'Bauke Bauke' is burnt into my brain, and supposedly the new voice system should keep callouts more helpful. But its the volume of callouts thats gone down, and the game is worse for it. 

